024-01-23T21:08:04Z","updated_at":"2024-01-23T21:08:04Z","body":"@elastic/es-distributed this is really weird. \r\n\r\nIn the `DenseVectorFieldMapper` we override the codec used so that this error isn't thrown. The value shown in the error indicates that the document indexing path was executed without our overridden codec settings.\r\n\r\nI am digging into the various `_mget` paths and its starting to think it has something to do with us getting realtime values via the Translog. \r\n\r\nDo we do anything there that simulates the indexing path for a document that relies on the default codecs being used?","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/elastic/elasticsearch/issues/comments/1906920136/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"event":"commented","actor":{"login":"benwtrent","id":4357155,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQzNTcxNTU=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4357155?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/benwtrent","html_url":"https://github.com/benwtrent","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/benwtrent/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/benwtrent/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/benwtrent/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/benwtrent/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/benwtrent/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/benwtrent/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/benwtrent/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/benwtrent/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/benwtrent/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false}},{"id":11576124136,"node_id":"SE_lADOAAe_f8584gfvzwAAAAKx_aLo","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/elastic/elasticsearch/issues/events/11576